{"id":"normal-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":85,\"rain_chance_percent\":20,\"wind_speed_mph\":10,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":5.72,\"corn_price\":4.18,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["wheat price","5.72","approved"],"must_not_contain":["extreme heat","heat advisory","high wind","heavy rain"],"judge_criteria":"The output should show a normal monitoring result with only the wheat price alert and an approved final status."}
{"id":"heat-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":97,\"rain_chance_percent\":20,\"wind_speed_mph\":10,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":5.72,\"corn_price\":4.18,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["heat advisory","97","wheat price","approved"],"must_not_contain":["extreme heat","high wind","heavy rain"],"judge_criteria":"Pass if the output includes a heat advisory for 97 degrees, includes the correct wheat price, and does not generate an extreme heat, high wind, or heavy rain alert. It does not need to explicitly explain why 97 degrees is not extreme heat."}
{"id":"extreme-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":103,\"rain_chance_percent\":20,\"wind_speed_mph\":10,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":6.11,\"corn_price\":4.22,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["extreme heat","103","6.11","approved"],"must_not_contain":["heat advisory","high wind","heavy rain"],"judge_criteria":"The output should correctly report extreme heat at 103 degrees, include the correct wheat price, and remain grounded in the test data."}
{"id":"wind-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":88,\"rain_chance_percent\":20,\"wind_speed_mph\":25,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":5.50,\"corn_price\":4.10,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["high wind advisory","25","5.50","approved"],"must_not_contain":["extreme heat","heat advisory","heavy rain"],"judge_criteria":"Pass if the output includes a high wind advisory for 25 miles per hour, includes the correct wheat price, and does not generate an extreme heat, heat advisory, or heavy rain alert. The wheat price is an expected part of every AgInsight result and should not be treated as unrelated."}
{"id":"rain-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":82,\"rain_chance_percent\":80,\"wind_speed_mph\":12,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":5.95,\"corn_price\":4.25,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["heavy rain","80","5.95","approved"],"must_not_contain":["extreme heat","heat advisory","high wind"],"judge_criteria":"The output should warn that heavy rain may affect field work and should include the correct 80 percent rain chance."}
{"id":"multi-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":101,\"rain_chance_percent\":75,\"wind_speed_mph\":24,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":6.25,\"corn_price\":4.40,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["extreme heat","high wind advisory","heavy rain","6.25","approved"],"must_not_contain":["heat advisory"],"judge_criteria":"The output should include all three supported weather alerts, the correct wheat price, and no unsupported claims."}
{"id":"boundary-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":95,\"rain_chance_percent\":70,\"wind_speed_mph\":20,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":5.72,\"corn_price\":4.18,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["heat advisory","high wind advisory","heavy rain","5.72","approved"],"must_not_contain":["extreme heat"],"judge_criteria":"The output should correctly include every alert that begins exactly at its threshold: 95 degrees, 20 mile-per-hour wind, and 70 percent rain chance."}
{"id":"format-01","prompt":"{\"weather\":{\"temperature_f\":90,\"rain_chance_percent\":30,\"wind_speed_mph\":15,\"data_source\":\"test\"},\"commodities\":{\"wheat_price\":5.72,\"corn_price\":4.18,\"wheat_date\":\"test\",\"corn_date\":\"test\",\"data_source\":\"test\"}}","must_contain":["initial_alert","final_alert","final_status","approved"],"must_not_contain":["nan","null"],"max_chars":2000,"judge_criteria":"The output should be valid, readable JSON containing the initial alert, the grounding results, the final alert, and the final approval status."}